wgvim
=====

wgvim is a modified version of Neovim. Nearly all of the code, documentation and
design in this repository is the work of the Neovim contributors and, before them,
of Bram Moolenaar and the Vim contributors. Their work is the reason this software
exists, and the credit for it belongs to them, not to the maintainers of wgvim.

wgvim is NOT the Neovim project, is not affiliated with it, and is not endorsed
or supported by it. Please do not report problems in wgvim to the Neovim project.
Defects introduced by the modifications listed below are ours, not theirs.

